title: NoSQL Injection Attempt
id: 2f743715-6204-4aeb-9789-58d2a89de146
status: experimental
description: Detects NoSQL injection payloads in HTTP requests, such as MongoDB operator injection ($ne, $gt, $where, $regex) used to bypass authentication or extract data from document databases.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/
logsource:
  category: webserver
detection:
  selection:
    cs-uri-query|contains:
      - '$ne'
      - '$gt'
      - '$where'
      - '$regex'
      - '[$ne]='
  condition: selection
fields:
  - cs-uri-query
  - cs-uri-stem
  - c-ip
falsepositives:
  - Applications legitimately using these parameter names
level: high
tags:
  - attack.initial_access
  - attack.t1190
